"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"012fc246a18e6b2b0c95ed8436e9461e4ade143c38b09448e666ab21bb6a0520\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actor height 1.65 1.70 character married three times one child survives series\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... He was married a total of seven times, and fathered eight children.\\n\\nAfter long battles with ill health, Richard Pryor passed away on December 10th, 2005.- Vincent Schiavelli, selected in 1997 by Vanity Fair as one of the best character actors in America, had made over 120 film ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2005&ref_=nmbio\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... portrayed the titular character of multiple Greek tragedies, including Antigone (1961) and Electra (1964). Her final role was in the 2004 film Ecuba, which she co-directed with Giuliana Berlinguer.\\n\\nMark Miller\\n\\nMark Miller, the actor and screenwriter known for starring on the TV series Please Don't ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/celebrity/stars-we-lost-in-2022/?srsltid=AfmBOoqgtseDJPvB8Bamfe3oZlhWJZaiC5kf4fxP0pjffkBximQEpPNy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... His life partner, Michele Roberge, told The New York Times that the actor died following a battle with Alzheimer's disease. Birney was best known for his roles on St. Elsewhere and Bridget Loves Bernie. Meredith Baxter was Birney's co-star on the latter TV series, and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.etonline.com/gallery/star